2105..2182 Comment "/// Winding a composite is summing the windings (cubical\'s `winding-hom`), by"
2183..2257 Comment "/// induction on the first loop, written last so its match stands directly"
2258..2336 Comment "/// under the recursion, where the checkers read it as a fold, and summed with"
2337..2401 Comment "/// `wind(q)` first because the sum descends its second summand:"
2402..2477 Comment "/// `here(wind(q))` on the empty word, and the recursive call carried along"
2478..2551 Comment "/// `up` or `down`. The composite in its type is read off the parameters\'"
2552..2611 Comment "/// written types (#423), and the kernel reads its endpoint"
2612..2671 Comment "/// `plus(wind(q), wind(p))` as the call it returns (#424)."
